 "remarks": "20 Hanover St. #A features a well-maintained traditional multifamily totaling approximately 2,525 living sqft with (3) 2BR/1BA units. The property presents significant value-add potential through cosmetic renovations and future rent growth. 20 Hanover St. #B, constructed in 2003, consists of (3) spacious 2BR/1.5BA townhouse-style units totaling approximately 4,500 living sqft. Each unit offers highly desirable layouts with central air, finished basements, private decks, and modern townhouse living rarely found in this location. Highlights include strong tenant demand, excellent commuter location with close proximity to Metro-North and I-95, walkability to Stamford beaches and waterfront amenities, and a diversified unit mix attractive to a wide tenant pool. A rare opportunity for investors seeking a well-located multifamily portfolio in one of Stamford's strongest rental markets.",
